   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "This, along with continued good contribution from Defence, gives us confidence that we will see positive momentum in our financial performance in 2022 despite the challenges and risks around the pace of market recovery, global supply chain disruption and rising inflation.",
